; Parity corpus (synthetic data, S0094): two documents roots scanned by Beancount's documents step, a dated file
; for a nested account and for an account opened in the other root, an undated file it skips, a folder for an
; account that is not opened, a file found for a closed account, a document directive with a relative path, and one
; whose file is missing (an error).
option "title" "Documents roots"
option "operating_currency" "USD"
option "documents" "docs"
option "documents" "archive"

